{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Everything around you is made of something called matter.","words":[[0,0.57],[0.64,1.02],[1.09,1.21],[1.29,1.39],[1.49,1.72],[1.76,1.83],[1.93,2.44],[2.54,2.93],[3.06,3.9]]},{"text":"Matter can be solid, liquid, or gas.","words":[[0,0.38],[0.45,0.6],[0.66,0.78],[0.84,1.37],[1.47,1.88],[1.9,2.01],[2.08,2.88]]},{"text":"A solid keeps its shape. A block or a rock is a solid.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.22,0.65],[0.72,1.07],[1.13,1.29],[1.33,1.75],[1.78,1.85],[1.94,2.29],[2.37,2.5],[2.57,2.61],[2.71,2.96],[3.03,3.13],[3.19,3.24],[3.31,4.13]]},{"text":"You cannot easily change the shape of a solid.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.26,0.6],[0.69,1.1],[1.18,1.56],[1.6,1.67],[1.74,2.09],[2.14,2.23],[2.3,2.35],[2.44,3.3]]},{"text":"A liquid can flow and change shape.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.21,0.6],[0.67,0.86],[0.96,1.35],[1.44,1.59],[1.67,2.09],[2.14,2.97]]},{"text":"Water is a liquid because it takes the shape of its container.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.49,0.59],[0.65,0.7],[0.77,1.18],[1.25,1.61],[1.66,1.75],[1.8,2.1],[2.15,2.22],[2.29,2.63],[2.68,2.77],[2.84,3.01],[3.08,4.13]]},{"text":"A gas spreads out and fills the space around it.","words":[[0,0.12],[0.21,0.49],[0.55,1.07],[1.14,1.41],[1.46,1.58],[1.67,2.01],[2.06,2.13],[2.17,2.61],[2.66,3.02],[3.1,3.71]]},{"text":"Air is a gas. We cannot see it, but it is all around us.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.36,0.48],[0.53,0.56],[0.63,1.14],[1.43,1.57],[1.63,1.99],[2.06,2.28],[2.33,2.45],[2.5,2.68],[2.75,2.86],[2.93,3.05],[3.13,3.35],[3.42,3.77],[3.85,4.46]]},{"text":"Sometimes matter can change from one state to another.","words":[[0,0.63],[0.73,1.03],[1.1,1.28],[1.36,1.76],[1.81,2.04],[2.18,2.43],[2.48,2.83],[2.88,2.95],[3.03,3.85]]},{"text":"Solids, liquids, and gases are the three main states of matter.","words":[[0,0.64],[0.72,1.23],[1.25,1.39],[1.47,1.97],[2.06,2.25],[2.3,2.37],[2.46,2.77],[2.84,3.09],[3.16,3.61],[3.67,3.76],[3.87,4.69]]}]}